   PNG with its own two-colour palette; it does not inherit currentColor the way
   the previous drawn mark did, so the footer gets a lightened variant (see
   .site-footer .mark in main.css) to stay legible against --ink. #}
<img class="mark" src="/assets/img/logo-76.png"
     srcset="/assets/img/logo-76.png 1x, /assets/img/logo-114.png 1.5x"
     width="38" height="38" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async">
